0..78 Comment "// A cancellation posts its own completion, and the target\'s is still owed, in"
79..158 Comment "// either order (io_uring_prep_cancel(3), io_uring_cancelation(7)). The two are"
159..234 Comment "// independent pending completions, not one sequence, so a program may reap"
235..307 Comment "// them in either order. In the first two each is served by its own mock"
308..378 Comment "// kernel; in the last two the cancellation takes the target\'s pending"
379..423 Comment "// completion over its session and reaps it."
425..464 Comment "// The ring\'s protocol and its entries."
